        {
            "title": "〈熱門股〉雙鴻今年營收可望年增7成、明年更勝今年 無懼關禁閉周漲3成創高",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">雙鴻(3324-TW)本季起將有輝達(NVDA-US)VR系列開始貢獻，ASIC產品則在第四季挹注，法人看好，今年全年營收可望年增7成，且明年表現將更勝今年，激勵雙鴻本周無懼遭列處置股，周漲3成，並衝上1485元創歷史新天價。 </p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">雙鴻本周漲30.26%，於周四(3日)稍作休息，周五再攻高，衝上1485元漲停鎖死，並創歷史新天價，站穩所有均線，排名千金股第33名。三大法人也持續敲進雙鴻，已連續7個交易日買超，合計買超9412張。 </p><div class=\"bg-toast-background -mx-5 -mt-2 mb-3 pb-3 md:-mx-0 lg:mx-auto lg:w-[300px] lg:pb-0\"><div class=\"text-px14 text-gandalf py-1 text-center leading-5\">廣告</div><div class=\"mx-auto text-center min-w-[300px] min-h-[250px]\" id=\"sda-inbody-c627d6c6-0384-31bd-968e-a29298789846-1-iframe\"><div class=\"bg-dirty-seagull text-px12 text-dolphin mx-auto hidden items-center justify-center only:flex w-[300px] h-[250px]\">廣告</div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">雙鴻Vera Rubin除有分歧管(Manifold)持續穩定供應，董事長林育申於近日證實，已重回水冷板(Cold plate)供應鏈名單，力拚9月完成驗證，預期Vera Rubin實際貢獻時程將落在9、10月。 </p><div class=\"recommendation-contents\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mb-2 h-[30px] w-[80px] rounded-lg\"></div><div class=\"no-scrollbar -mx-5 mb-5 flex overflow-hidden overflow-x-auto md:-mx-2 lg:mb-3.5\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mr-2 ml-5 h-[92px] w-[calc(85%-28px)] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg md:ml-2 md:w-[calc(85%-16px)] lg:h-[120px] lg:w-[calc(50%-16px)]\"></div><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mx-2 h-[92px] w-[85%] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg lg:h-[120px] lg:w-[calc(50%-16px)]\"></div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">另外，ASIC也成為雙鴻另一成長動能，林育申表示，第四季將有AWS及META專案貢獻，且明年第一季可望有新專案加入。他並指出，今年底有望達成ASIC單月營收占比達4成的目標。</p><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\" \" class=\"rounded-lg\" height=\"828\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/4cf58f864a1de73e75425689d0a87b45a37e03176d93ecaa7356d1f63a6e58a4/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fca%2Fcnyes_hk_559%2Ff8970501f54f3bbe5d2971883d2ccb3a.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption class=\"text-px14 text-dolphin mt-2 wrap-anywhere\" style=\"max-width:960px\"> </figcaption></div></figure><p class=\"read-more-vendor mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\"><span>更多鉅亨報導</span><br/>•<a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"〈焦點股〉雙鴻7月賺逾半個股本 無懼關禁閉強攻漲停再創新高\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:〈焦點股〉雙鴻7月賺逾半個股本 無懼關禁閉強攻漲停再創新高;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://news.cnyes.com/news/id/6587962?utm_source=yahoo&amp;utm_medium=RSS&amp;utm_campaign=relate\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">〈焦點股〉雙鴻7月賺逾半個股本 無懼關禁閉強攻漲停再創新高</a><br/>•<a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"雙鴻GPU與ASIC雙引擎帶動Q4登高峰 明年營收更上一層樓\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:雙鴻GPU與ASIC雙引擎帶動Q4登高峰 明年營收更上一層樓;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://news.cnyes.com/news/id/6593885?utm_source=yahoo&amp;utm_medium=RSS&amp;utm_campaign=relate\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">雙鴻GPU與ASIC雙引擎帶動Q4登高峰 明年營收更上一層樓</a></p></div>",
