        {
            "title": "〈熱門股〉散裝業下半年優於上半年 裕民股價創逾5年來新高",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">散裝航商裕民(2606-TW)本周股價漲逾8%，一度觸及80元整數價位，創2021年7月中旬以來新高，主要是因散裝市場供需吃緊，且逐漸進入第四季傳統旺季，市場樂觀偏多看待下半年相關業者的獲利有望優於上半年。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">法人分析，大型船方面，儘管受到暑期淡季影響，惟長航程貨源增加，且有效運力供給偏緊，支撐鐵礦砂運價走升，隨著旺季到來，運價處高檔可期。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">而中小型船第三季以來運價大致持平，9月下旬起迎來北美穀物出口旺季，也有助激勵後續運價表現。</p><div class=\"bg-toast-background -mx-5 -mt-2 mb-3 pb-3 md:-mx-0 lg:mx-auto lg:w-[300px] lg:pb-0\"><div class=\"text-px14 text-gandalf py-1 text-center leading-5\">廣告</div><div class=\"mx-auto text-center min-w-[300px] min-h-[250px]\" id=\"sda-inbody-6e5342f6-5aa9-3ce8-84b8-d7c75991fdda-1-iframe\"><div class=\"bg-dirty-seagull text-px12 text-dolphin mx-auto hidden items-center justify-center only:flex w-[300px] h-[250px]\">廣告</div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">據海運研調機構Clarksons預估，今年乾散貨貿易量年增1.6%，其中鐵礦砂年增2%、穀物年增3.5%，鋁礬土需求年增更達15.7%，儘管煤炭需求則年減1.2%，整體散裝運輸需求仍維持成長。</p><div class=\"recommendation-contents\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mb-2 h-[30px] w-[80px] rounded-lg\"></div><div class=\"no-scrollbar -mx-5 mb-5 flex overflow-hidden overflow-x-auto md:-mx-2 lg:mb-3.5\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mr-2 ml-5 h-[92px] w-[calc(85%-28px)] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg md:ml-2 md:w-[calc(85%-16px)] lg:h-[120px] lg:w-[calc(50%-16px)]\"></div><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mx-2 h-[92px] w-[85%] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg lg:h-[120px] lg:w-[calc(50%-16px)]\"></div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">而從供給面來看，新船交付量仍相對有限、環保法規趨嚴壓縮有效運力，且目前二手船價格維持高檔，供需結構有撐。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">目前裕民旗下船隊涵蓋海岬型 (Capesize)、巴拿馬極限型 (Panamax)、超巴拿馬型 (PostPanamax)、超輕便型 (Ultramax)、水泥專用船、超大型油輪 (VLCC) 和超大型礦砂船 (VLOC) 等，更跨足海洋風電人員運輸船 (CTV)、運維服務船 (CSOV) 和液化天然氣 (LNG) 運輸船等，總運力達 86 艘，總載重噸已突破1000 萬噸里程碑。</p><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\" \" class=\"rounded-lg\" height=\"828\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/ce45b6974a682a2fc382724f30bc80f9fc0d485b7e0420a81d09ed90e5031ef7/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fcnyes_hk_559%2F11343c8ce69f830158bb18f665b470bb.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption class=\"text-px14 text-dolphin mt-2 wrap-anywhere\" style=\"max-width:960px\"> </figcaption></div></figure><p class=\"read-more-vendor mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\"><span>更多鉅亨報導</span><br/>•<a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"散裝航運旺季將至 估運價有望維持高檔至年底\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:散裝航運旺季將至 估運價有望維持高檔至年底;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://news.cnyes.com/news/id/6585119?utm_source=yahoo&amp;utm_medium=RSS&amp;utm_campaign=relate\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">散裝航運旺季將至 估運價有望維持高檔至年底</a><br/>•<a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"裕民訂造2艘21萬噸級散裝船 總運力首度突破千萬噸\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:裕民訂造2艘21萬噸級散裝船 總運力首度突破千萬噸;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://news.cnyes.com/news/id/6508994?utm_source=yahoo&amp;utm_medium=RSS&amp;utm_campaign=relate\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">裕民訂造2艘21萬噸級散裝船 總運力首度突破千萬噸</a></p></div>",
            "link": "https://hk.news.yahoo.com/%E7%86%B1%E9%96%80%E8%82%A1-%E6%95%A3%E8%A3%9D%E6%A5%AD%E4%B8%8B%E5%8D%8A%E5%B9%B4%E5%84%AA%E6%96%BC%E4%B8%8A%E5%8D%8A%E5%B9%B4-%E8%A3%95%E6%B0%91%E8%82%A1%E5%83%B9%E5%89%B5%E9%80%BE5%E5%B9%B4%E4%BE%86%E6%96%B0%E9%AB%98-020553426.html",
